{
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "slug": "number-count",
  "title": "Number count",
  "group": "Motion",
  "order": 9,
  "summary": {
    "en": "When a number changes in front of someone, each digit column rolls to its new value on the smooth spring, and bars and rings glide to their new length on the in-out curve. The change is visible, the new value is readable at once, and the width never jumps.",
    "id": "Saat angka berubah di depan seseorang, setiap kolom digit bergulir ke nilai barunya dengan smooth spring, dan bar serta ring meluncur ke panjang barunya dengan kurva in-out. Perubahannya terlihat, nilai barunya langsung terbaca, dan lebarnya tidak pernah melompat."
  },
  "titleId": "Number count",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A stepper the person drives",
        "desc": "Each press rolls only the digits that change; going from 19 to 20 rolls both columns at once.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\">\n  <span class=\"field__label\" id=\"nc-seat\">Bus seats to reserve</span>\n  <div class=\"stepper-field\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"nc-seat\" data-lds-stepper data-min=\"1\" data-max=\"40\" data-value=\"18\">\n    <button aria-label=\"Fewer seats\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">remove</span></button>\n    <span class=\"stepper-field__value\"><span class=\"roll\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></span>\n    <button aria-label=\"More seats\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">add</span></button>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "A live count",
        "desc": "Patients seen at a puskesmas through the morning. The figure rolls each time; the label stays put.",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"min-width: 240px;\">\n  <p class=\"card__sub\">Patients seen so far</p>\n  <p class=\"chart-card__big\"><span class=\"roll\" data-lds-roll=\"27\" id=\"nc-live\"></span><span class=\"card__sub\" style=\"display: inline;\"> of 32</span></p>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\" onclick=\"const el = document.getElementById('nc-live'); const v = Number(el.getAttribute('aria-label')); import('../../js/lds.js').then((m) => m.setRoll(el, v >= 32 ? 27 : v + 1));\">Simulate one patient</button>\n</div>",
        "code": "<span class=\"roll\" data-lds-roll=\"27\"></span>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { setRoll } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  setRoll(document.querySelector('.roll'), 28);\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Progress that moves",
        "desc": "The bar and the ring glide to the new value on the in-out curve (480 ms): something already on screen moving, not arriving.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 360px;\" data-p=\"60\">\n  <div class=\"progress-meta\"><span>Documents complete</span><b>12 of 20 files</b></div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"60\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-label=\"Documents complete\"><div class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.6);\"></div></div>\n  <div class=\"docs-row\"><div class=\"ring\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Documents complete 60 percent\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle class=\"ring__track\" cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"27\"></circle><circle class=\"ring__val\" cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"27\" stroke-dasharray=\"169.6\" stroke-dashoffset=\"67.8\"></circle></svg><span class=\"ring__label\">60%</span></div><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" onclick=\"const box = this.closest('.docs-col'); let p = Number(box.dataset.p || 60); p = p >= 100 ? 20 : p + 20; box.dataset.p = p; box.querySelector('.progress__fill').style.transform = 'scaleX(' + p / 100 + ')'; box.querySelector('.progress').setAttribute('aria-valuenow', p); box.querySelector('.ring__val').setAttribute('stroke-dashoffset', (169.6 * (1 - p / 100)).toFixed(1)); box.querySelector('.ring__label').textContent = p + '%'; box.querySelector('.ring').setAttribute('aria-label', 'Documents complete ' + p + ' percent');\">Upload a file</button></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Stepper yang dikendalikan orang",
        "desc": "Setiap tekanan hanya menggulirkan digit yang berubah; dari 19 ke 20 menggulirkan kedua kolom sekaligus.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\">\n  <span class=\"field__label\" id=\"nc-seat\">Kursi bus yang dipesan</span>\n  <div class=\"stepper-field\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"nc-seat\" data-lds-stepper data-min=\"1\" data-max=\"40\" data-value=\"18\">\n    <button aria-label=\"Kurangi kursi\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">remove</span></button>\n    <span class=\"stepper-field__value\"><span class=\"roll\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></span>\n    <button aria-label=\"Tambah kursi\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">add</span></button>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Hitungan langsung",
        "desc": "Pasien yang selesai dilayani di puskesmas sepanjang pagi. Angkanya bergulir setiap kali; labelnya tetap di tempat.",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"min-width: 240px;\">\n  <p class=\"card__sub\">Pasien terlayani sejauh ini</p>\n  <p class=\"chart-card__big\"><span class=\"roll\" data-lds-roll=\"27\" id=\"nc-live\"></span><span class=\"card__sub\" style=\"display: inline;\"> dari 32</span></p>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\" onclick=\"const el = document.getElementById('nc-live'); const v = Number(el.getAttribute('aria-label')); import('../../js/lds.js').then((m) => m.setRoll(el, v >= 32 ? 27 : v + 1));\">Simulasikan satu pasien</button>\n</div>",
        "code": "<span class=\"roll\" data-lds-roll=\"27\"></span>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { setRoll } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  setRoll(document.querySelector('.roll'), 28);\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Progres yang bergerak",
        "desc": "Bar dan ring meluncur ke nilai baru dengan kurva in-out (480 ms): sesuatu yang sudah tampil sedang bergerak, bukan baru tiba.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 360px;\" data-p=\"60\">\n  <div class=\"progress-meta\"><span>Kelengkapan berkas</span><b>12 dari 20 berkas</b></div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"60\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-label=\"Kelengkapan berkas\"><div class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.6);\"></div></div>\n  <div class=\"docs-row\"><div class=\"ring\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Kelengkapan berkas 60 persen\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle class=\"ring__track\" cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"27\"></circle><circle class=\"ring__val\" cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"27\" stroke-dasharray=\"169.6\" stroke-dashoffset=\"67.8\"></circle></svg><span class=\"ring__label\">60%</span></div><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" onclick=\"const box = this.closest('.docs-col'); let p = Number(box.dataset.p || 60); p = p >= 100 ? 20 : p + 20; box.dataset.p = p; box.querySelector('.progress__fill').style.transform = 'scaleX(' + p / 100 + ')'; box.querySelector('.progress').setAttribute('aria-valuenow', p); box.querySelector('.ring__val').setAttribute('stroke-dashoffset', (169.6 * (1 - p / 100)).toFixed(1)); box.querySelector('.ring__label').textContent = p + '%'; box.querySelector('.ring').setAttribute('aria-label', 'Kelengkapan berkas ' + p + ' persen');\">Unggah satu berkas</button></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
